---
import config from "@/config/config.json";
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const { address, email, phone, siren, adeli } = config.contactinfo;
---

<Base
  title="Legal Notice"
  meta_title="Legal Notice – Marie Nussbaum"
  description="Legal notice for marienussbaum.com – publisher information, hosting, and data protection."
  hreflangPaths={{ en: "/legal", fr: "/mentions-legales" }}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="h2 page-heading">Legal Notice</h1>

      <div class="content max-w-3xl">

        <h2>1. Site Publisher</h2>
        <p>
          Marie Nussbaum<br />
          Clinical Psychologist and Psychoanalyst<br />
          ADELI/RPPS number: {adeli}<br />
          SIREN: {siren}<br />
          {address}<br />
          Phone: {phone}<br />
          Email: <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>
        </p>

        <h2>2. Publication Director</h2>
        <p>Marie Nussbaum</p>

        <h2>3. Hosting</h2>
        <p>
          GitHub, Inc.<br />
          88 Colin P Kelly Jr St<br />
          San Francisco, CA 94107, United States<br />
          <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com</a>
        </p>

        <h2>4. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          All content on this site (texts, images, blog articles) is protected by copyright.
          Any reproduction, even partial, is prohibited without prior written authorisation from the publisher.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Confidentiality of Clinical Material</h2>
        <p>
          The clinical situations, accounts, and cases referred to in blog articles are either fictional or have
          been substantially altered — including names, biographical details, and circumstances — in order to
          protect the identity and privacy of the individuals concerned. Any resemblance to real persons, living
          or deceased, is entirely coincidental. These narratives are intended solely to illustrate psychological
          dynamics for educational purposes.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Security — Cloudflare</h2>
        <p>
          This site is protected by <strong>Cloudflare</strong> (Cloudflare, Inc., 101 Townsend St, San
          Francisco, CA 94107, United States), a security and content delivery network (CDN) service. To protect
          the site against malicious traffic (DDoS attacks, bots, spam), Cloudflare may set security cookies in
          your browser.
        </p>
        <p>
          These cookies are <strong>strictly necessary</strong> for the security and proper functioning of the
          site. They enable Cloudflare to distinguish legitimate human visitors from automated malicious access.
          They are not used for advertising, behavioural tracking, profiling, or any form of data sharing for
          commercial purposes.
        </p>
        <p>
          Strictly necessary security cookies do not require prior consent under the GDPR. For more information:
          <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Cloudflare Privacy Policy
          </a>.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Data Protection (GDPR)</h2>
        <p>
          Beyond the Cloudflare security cookies described above, this site does not collect any personal data
          without your explicit consent. No tracking or profiling cookies are used. Information submitted via the
          contact form is used solely to respond to your enquiry and is not retained beyond that purpose.
        </p>
        <p>
          In accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and French data protection law, you
          have the right to access, correct, and delete your personal data. To exercise this right, please
          contact: <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          The content of this site is provided for informational purposes only and does not constitute medical
          or psychological advice. Marie Nussbaum cannot be held liable for any use made of the information
          published on this site.
        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
